        "question_id": "q-134549",
        "problem": "Determine the measure of angle $\\alpha .$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $\\alpha =$  \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${}^{∘}$",
        "status": "ambiguous",
